<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Danki</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 1549</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Danki</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Danki was fought around c. 1549 in present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/senegal">Senegal</a> between the forces of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/amari-ngone-sobel-fall">Amari Ngone Sobel Fall</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cayor">Cayor</a> and the army of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jolof-empire">Jolof Empire</a>. Jolof's ruler was defeated and killed. The battle ended Jolof's dominance over the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wolof">Wolof</a> states, which then became independent kingdoms.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-danki.jpg" alt="Battle of Danki" width="320" height="345" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: 4shizzal · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wolof_Empire.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
